ilmentufa/camxes appears to be missing a few of the changes to BPFK 
morphology that were made since October, specifically:

* v121: change to "glide" 
<http://tiki.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-pagehistory.php?page=BPFK+Section%3A+PEG+Morphology+Algorithm&history_offset=0&diff_style=sidediff&diff_style=sidediff&show_all_versions=y&compare=Compare&newver=121&oldver=120&tra_lang=ar&paginate=on&history_pagesize=50>
* v132: change to "consontantal_syllable" 
<http://tiki.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-pagehistory.php?page=BPFK+Section%3A+PEG+Morphology+Algorithm&history_offset=0&diff_style=sidediff&diff_style=sidediff&show_all_versions=y&compare=Compare&newver=132&oldver=131&tra_lang=ar&paginate=on&history_pagesize=50>
* v133: change to "stressed_hy_rafsi" 
<http://tiki.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-pagehistory.php?page=BPFK+Section%3A+PEG+Morphology+Algorithm&history_offset=0&diff_style=sidediff&show_all_versions=y&compare=Compare&newver=132&oldver=131&paginate=on&history_pagesize=50&bothver_idx=49>

If there's any difference between the parse which is not attributable to 
one of these changes, then it's a bug. However, at least some of the 
differences are due to these rule changes.

What's wrong with these two? There's no CGV in them. "bad,nr,gru,te" and 
> "bak,nr,ze,bu". 
>
> I agree. These parse in my local camxes. Can you look into this, mukti?
>
 {badnrgrute} and {baknrzebu} both parse without the change to the 
consonantal syllable rule in v132.

> > catnrpepiskopo 
>
> What's wrong with this? 
>
> I don't know. mukti, can you debug this one as well?
>
Also due to change in v132. {cipnrpika}, {gurnrtefi} and many others are in 
the same category.

Are people familiar with the theory behind this change? Is it acceptable? 
Or is there a reason that it was not propagated? If it's not something that 
we want to keep, the BPFK morphology algorithm page should be updated to 
reflect that. On a related note, this might be a good time to start 
discussing the migration of the official BPFK work pages to the mediawiki.

I'll refrain from propagating these changes to jbovlaste/vlatai until 
there's a sense of what should be done.

-- 
